works: The summer is crowded and loud, and one of the best {N} remembers.
works: {sibling} and {N} grow closer, and the baby knows {N} by the end of it.
fails: Tempers fray in the heat, and the last weeks drag.
fails not W>B B>G: Something small turns into a quarrel, and {sibling} leaves early.

